;Cave:	The Mohole - Turbary Road

*begin	Mohole

*export Entrance Wall
*entrance Entrance

;Commented out as Kevin Dixon GPS location now used
;*fix Wall 	68584 76979 404 ;entrance GPS by Julian Todd 9 Oct 2011 - Garmin Etrex to 3m accuracy - original reading of 30U 6004519 0533739 using WGS84 then converted to OS coordinates

*include Mohole1
*include Mohole2
*include Mohole3
*include Mohole4

;--------------------------------------------------------------------

*equate Entrance Mohole1.3
*equate Mohole1.1 Wall 
*equate Mohole1.6 Mohole2.6x
*equate Mohole3.9 Mohole2.11
*equate Mohole3.7 Mohole4.7x

*end	Mohole